{
  "comment": "Canonical conformance vectors for docs/data-model.md. Every SDK and the web UI evaluator must pass all of these verbatim. stable_id values are post-normalization (already trimmed + lowercased). Extend this file in the same PR as any evaluator change.",
  "schema_version": 2,

  "bucketing": {
    "comment": "bucket = big_endian_uint32(sha256(utf8(flag_key + ':' + stable_id))[0..3]) mod 100. A rule's rollout gate passes iff bucket < rollout_percent.",
    "vectors": [
      { "flag_key": "new_paywall", "stable_id": "0b9e4c3a-1111-4222-8333-444455556666", "expected_bucket": 55 },
      { "flag_key": "new_paywall", "stable_id": "user-123", "expected_bucket": 50 },
      { "flag_key": "grocery_v2", "stable_id": "user-123", "expected_bucket": 25 },
      { "flag_key": "grocery_v2", "stable_id": "user-c", "expected_bucket": 9 },
      { "flag_key": "grocery_v2", "stable_id": "0b9e4c3a-1111-4222-8333-444455556666", "expected_bucket": 88 },
      { "flag_key": "import_batch_size", "stable_id": "user-123", "expected_bucket": 15 },
      { "flag_key": "import_batch_size", "stable_id": "user-456", "expected_bucket": 1 },
      { "flag_key": "import_batch_size", "stable_id": "user-a", "expected_bucket": 79 },
      { "flag_key": "import_multi_recipe", "stable_id": "anon-device-7f3d2b1c", "expected_bucket": 48 },
      { "flag_key": "import_multi_recipe", "stable_id": "sofia@example.com", "expected_bucket": 69 }
    ]
  },

  "email_hashing": {
    "comment": "email_hash = lowercase_hex(sha256(utf8(lowercase(trim(email)))))",
    "vectors": [
      { "input": " Sofia@Example.COM ", "expected_hash": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" },
      { "input": "sofia@example.com", "expected_hash": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" }
    ]
  },

  "evaluation": {
    "comment": "Each case: evaluate 'flag' against 'context' for a caller reading type 'read_as' with the compiled-in default 'code_default'; 'expected_value' is the required result. A flag is a list of overrides — the first rule whose conditions all match AND whose rollout gate passes serves its value, and every other outcome (flag absent, enabled false, no rule matched, anything unrecognized, a read of another type) is the code default. `isEnabled` is read_as 'bool'; there is no separate ON/OFF resolution.",
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "rule_with_no_conditions_matches_everyone",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "no conditions and no rollout_percent: everyone is overridden"
      },
      {
        "name": "no_rules_leaves_the_code_default_alone",
        "flag": { "key": "grocery_v2", "enabled": true, "rules": [] },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "a flag that overrides nobody is indistinguishable from no flag at all"
      },
      {
        "name": "no_rule_matches_leaves_the_code_default_alone",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "macos" } ], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "platform": "ios" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "master_switch_off_overrides_nobody_default_false",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": false,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "master_switch_off_overrides_nobody_default_true",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": false,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": false } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "enabled:false is 'no opinion', NOT 'off for everyone' — the app keeps its own default, whatever it is"
      },
      {
        "name": "conditionless_rule_forces_a_feature_off",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": false } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "how a feature whose build defaults it on is turned off remotely"
      },
      {
        "name": "allowlist_rule_beats_a_later_broad_rule",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "email_hash", "op": "eq", "value": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" } ], "value": true },
            { "conditions": [], "value": false }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "email_hash": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "first_matching_rule_wins",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "build", "op": "lt", "value": 9000 } ], "value": false },
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "email_hash", "op": "eq", "value": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" } ], "value": true }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "build": 8950, "email_hash": "9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "exclusions before inclusions: the legacy-build rule is reached first and later rules are not evaluated"
      },
      {
        "name": "conditions_within_rule_are_anded",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [
                { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "ios" },
                { "attribute": "build", "op": "gte", "value": 9000 }
              ], "value": true }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "platform": "ios", "build": 8999 },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "rollout_boundary_bucket_equal_percent_does_not_match",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 25, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "bucket(grocery_v2, user-123) == 25; the gate passes iff bucket < rollout_percent"
      },
      {
        "name": "rollout_boundary_bucket_below_percent_matches",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 26, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "rollout_percent_zero_matches_nobody",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 0, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-c" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "bucket(grocery_v2, user-c) == 9, and 9 < 0 is false"
      },
      {
        "name": "rollout_gate_is_anded_with_the_conditions",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "ios" } ], "rollout_percent": 26, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "platform": "macos" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "in the rollout, but the condition excludes them"
      },
      {
        "name": "bucketed_out_rule_falls_through_to_a_later_rule",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 25, "value": true },
            { "conditions": [], "value": false }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "bucket 25 is outside the 25% gate, so the rule is skipped like any non-matching rule and the next one is tried"
      },
      {
        "name": "semver_gte_multi_digit_component",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "app_version", "op": "semver_gte", "value": "5.9" } ], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "app_version": "5.10.0" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "numeric component comparison: 5.10.0 >= 5.9; string comparison would fail this"
      },
      {
        "name": "semver_eq_pads_missing_components",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "app_version", "op": "semver_eq", "value": "5.2" } ], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "app_version": "5.2.0" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "absent_attribute_matches_no_condition_positive_op",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "email_hash", "op": "in", "values": ["9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c"] } ], "value": true },
            { "conditions": [], "value": false }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "anon-device-7f3d2b1c", "is_anonymous": true },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "rule 1 does not match (no email in context); the conditionless rule below it does"
      },
      {
        "name": "absent_attribute_matches_no_condition_negative_op",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "email_hash", "op": "not_in", "values": ["9c9a2b4703917f82fe0261e52f280a480f0f5ae44f4f00b1d22d2b46597f0e1c"] } ], "value": true },
            { "conditions": [], "value": false }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "anon-device-7f3d2b1c", "is_anonymous": true },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "an absent attribute matches NO condition, including not_in/neq — that is ordinary non-matching, not rule 4"
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown_op_resolves_to_code_default_true",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "build", "op": "divisible_by", "value": 2 } ], "value": false },
            { "conditions": [], "value": false }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "build": 9042 },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "rule 4 fail-safe: the WHOLE flag falls back, not just the unparsable rule — skipping it would let the conditionless rule below apply to a user the unknown rule may have been excluding"
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown_op_resolves_to_code_default_false",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "build", "op": "divisible_by", "value": 2 } ], "value": true },
            { "conditions": [], "value": true }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "build": 9042 },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown_attribute_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "subscription_tier", "op": "eq", "value": "pro" } ], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "unparsable_semver_value_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "app_version", "op": "semver_gte", "value": "5.x" } ], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "app_version": "5.2.0" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown_rule_field_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "serve": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true,
        "note": "a pre-ADR-0014 rule read by a current evaluator: unknown field and no value, so rule 4 — this is also why the document version went to 2"
      },
      {
        "name": "rule_without_a_value_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [] } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "rollout_percent_out_of_range_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 250, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "not clamped to 100 — an out-of-range percentage is a construct this evaluator does not recognize"
      },
      {
        "name": "fractional_rollout_percent_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 12.5, "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-c" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "flag_absent_from_config_resolves_to_code_default",
        "flag": null,
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": true,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "int_flag_rule_serves_its_value",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 50 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 50
      },
      {
        "name": "int_flag_outside_the_rollout_keeps_the_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 10, "value": 50 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 10,
        "note": "bucket(import_batch_size, user-123) == 15; there is no configured 'off value' — the app's own 10 is it"
      },
      {
        "name": "rules_serve_different_values_to_different_users_first_slice",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 10, "value": 100 },
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 25, "value": 50 }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-456" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 100,
        "note": "bucket == 1, inside the first gate"
      },
      {
        "name": "rules_serve_different_values_to_different_users_second_slice",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 10, "value": 100 },
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 25, "value": 50 }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 50,
        "note": "bucket == 15: outside the first gate, inside the second — a ladder of conditionless rules slices the audience because the bucket is per flag"
      },
      {
        "name": "rules_serve_different_values_to_different_users_neither_slice",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 10, "value": 100 },
            { "conditions": [], "rollout_percent": 25, "value": 50 }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-a" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 10,
        "note": "bucket == 79"
      },
      {
        "name": "per_rule_values_by_condition",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "macos" } ], "value": 200 },
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "ios" } ], "value": 50 }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "platform": "ios" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 50
      },
      {
        "name": "double_flag_serves_fractional_value",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "double",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 1.5 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "double",
        "code_default": 0.75,
        "expected_value": 1.5
      },
      {
        "name": "integral_value_in_double_flag_is_served",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "double",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 2 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "double",
        "code_default": 0.75,
        "expected_value": 2,
        "note": "JSON cannot mark 2 as fractional, so a whole number is a legal double value"
      },
      {
        "name": "string_flag_serves_string_value",
        "flag": {
          "key": "new_paywall",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "string",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": "annual_first" } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "string",
        "code_default": "monthly_first",
        "expected_value": "annual_first"
      },
      {
        "name": "flag_without_value_type_reads_as_bool",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": true
      },
      {
        "name": "flag_without_value_type_read_as_int_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 7,
        "expected_value": 7
      },
      {
        "name": "read_of_wrong_type_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 50 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "double",
        "code_default": 0.5,
        "expected_value": 0.5,
        "note": "reads are exact: a double read of an int flag does not widen"
      },
      {
        "name": "int_flag_read_as_bool_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 50 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "isEnabled is the bool read, and this flag is not a bool flag (ADR 0014)"
      },
      {
        "name": "fractional_value_in_int_flag_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 1.5 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 10
      },
      {
        "name": "mistyped_value_in_a_later_rule_fails_the_whole_flag",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "int",
          "rules": [
            { "conditions": [], "value": 50 },
            { "conditions": [ { "attribute": "platform", "op": "eq", "value": "macos" } ], "value": "fifty" }
          ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123", "platform": "ios" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 10,
        "note": "the recognition pass covers every rule before any of them is matched, so a rule the evaluator would never have reached still trips the fail-safe"
      },
      {
        "name": "non_boolean_value_in_bool_flag_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "bool",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 1 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown_value_type_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "import_batch_size",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": "decimal",
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": 50 } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "int",
        "code_default": 10,
        "expected_value": 10
      },
      {
        "name": "null_value_type_is_code_default",
        "flag": {
          "key": "grocery_v2",
          "enabled": true,
          "value_type": null,
          "rules": [ { "conditions": [], "value": true } ]
        },
        "context": { "stable_id": "user-123" },
        "read_as": "bool",
        "code_default": false,
        "expected_value": false,
        "note": "absent means bool; present-as-null is a construct the evaluator does not recognize"
      },
      {
        "name": "null_rule_value_is_code_default",
